<title>UK: DePfa adds 50 mln marks to 10-year rex-linked bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa adds 50 mln marks to 10-year rex-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 250 million marks from 200 million marks, lead manager DG Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *250 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.70	MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 100 MILLION MARKS ON</p>
<p>		18.FEB.97 AND INCREASED BY A FURTHER 100 MILLION</p>
<p>		MARKS ON 19.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    **IN YEAR ONE THEN 81 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR REX SUB-</p>
<p>		INDEX THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
